ctive_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107789","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107789","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107789.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107789.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-19T18:08:47Z"},"body":"This PR builds on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105628 by unifying the iOS and visionOS Xcode project template files into a new Apple embedded Xcode project template.\r\n\r\nThe templates were largely identical, with a few set of small changes between them.\r\n\r\nThe new `EditorExportPlatformAppleEmbedded::_process_config_file_line()` function has been overridden on the iOS and visionOS export plugins to provide the specific values needed for each platform.\r\n\r\nI verified that the iOS and visionOS templates continue to build successfully, and have successfully exported and run the `platformer` sample for both platforms.\r\n\r\n(I suggest we target this to 4.6, no need to risk a regression in 4.5 while in beta.)\r\n\r\ncc @stuartcarnie @bruvzg ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received